The structural integrity of the scaffold was assessed using a tensile testing machine (EZ test, Shimadzu, Japan). The scaffolds were pre-immersed in DI water for 10 s and mounted with a gauge length of 30 mm and stretched at 20 mm/min. Each bilayer scaffold specimen was tested four times. The tensile strength (MPa) and percent elongation were calculated using standard formulas (1-2):1\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
